      "purpose": "Deduct allocation or in-transit inventory and optionally write per-shipment history.",
      "inputs_defaults": [
        "waveNum numeric(9), internalShipmentNum numeric(9), direction char(4), invTrack nchar(1), userName nvarchar(30), processStamp nvarchar(100), required; outputMode tinyint defaults to 0."
      ],
      "null_and_invalid_input_behavior": [
        "Wave/shipment selection uses OR: a nonzero wave or nonzero shipment can independently qualify a request; both zero select none. Unsupported/NULL direction takes neither branch. NULL tracking flag matches no request. No floor at zero prevents negative allocated or transit quantities."
